      "body": [
        {
          "component": "rich_text",
          "content": {
            "type": "doc",
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "content": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "The Arts and Culture Committee and Synergy Student Society collaborated for a week of festivities to commemorate the graduation of the Class of 2023. Students from all programmes under the School of Nursing and Midwifery took part in a Costume party, a traditional Dholki ceremony, and a batch dinner at Do Darya, Karachi."
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "content": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "Student Leaders and Office Bearers from both societies, as well as Class Representatives, took the lead in collaboration with the Office of Student Experience - Pakistan"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "content": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "The Costume Party displayed a double feature of blockbuster classics as students played dress-up for a photoshoot. The Dholki ceremony is an annual event students participate in, where graduating students hold a mock Dholki event to commemorate the year's end. The week-long festivities concluded with a batch dinner, where students travelled to Do Darya for their final batch dinner as AKU students."
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "hard_break"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "content": [
                  {
                    "type": "hard_break"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
